s[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]security_audit_fixes.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/security_audit_fixes.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-kf[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-kf/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gcal hostile title and badge URL escaping[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]gcal-escaping[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gcal-escaping: collapse newlines/control whitespace in calendar titles [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and percent-encode whitespace in badge URLs so a synced event can no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]longer forge daily-note Markdown; extend the hostile-title e2e test with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]multi-line cases.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web clip out-of-band fetch guard[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]web-clip-fetch-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]web-clip-fetch-guard: route image/PDF APIRequestContext fetches through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the private-network guard with per-hop redirect checks, escape < in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reader CSS title, and fix the sanitize-order bug that disabled [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inline-SVG externalization.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault sync and rewrite write durability[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-sync-durability[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-sync-durability: literal git pathspecs, a pre-restore byte recheck[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in clobber quarantine, conflict copies before merge aborts, fsync before[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename in the atomic-write helpers, and per-file stale rechecks in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite transaction.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank month-note parser fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-parser-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-parser-fixes: validate trailing tokens before the out-of-month [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]early return in day-heading parsing, parse frontmatter from BOM-stripped[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]text, and correct the latent write-planner anchors to match the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documented contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Subprocess reaper and notify hardening[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]subprocess-hardening[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]subprocess-hardening: bound the post-exit pipe-drain phase with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deadline, fix the straggler-kill PID-reuse ordering, and reject huge [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sleep values that panic Duration::from_secs_f64 in bob pomodoro notify.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shell and migration script fixes[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]script-small-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]script-small-fixes: honor bob_notify's --no-timeout escalation, make the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracker migration CRLF-safe and atomic with working duplicate-anchor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detection, and settle the decision-gated partial-registry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-targets behavior.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-kf","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-kf.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-050e6bdeb62b50c036a9b9c071812a84","started_at":"2026-11-11T18:39:16.610244+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1794429994,"sha":"6e3d88370351cc416301817fab6dab01761d5bd2","subject":"fix(git): move vault_git tests after is_ignored"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"9f2a1d476b83282de80c62474add662819b6dfb73148642b305ca39d5bc20a88","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":13360},"commits":{"digest":"beaae3c8bbe5e138e3d09a136755ec4382d6932e9d292e916f106b50b11f2072","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":225},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"207316df59b9204fe7fac3291df28e121936791d7a046bc1563859aac75e7386","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":860},"prompt":{"digest":"5c9e776fc2d15d68fd9d0a6bc74de9c9370e39e107079b71472a0b8bb5a592bc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/prompt.md","size_bytes":344},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"6848790f2069b94d17daabf7211f4cb275e06f78cb32a28d7f1f28d07c9e820d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":11185},"state":{"digest":"9d2c6c246eac2fb27e75c74944f38f5ce678bab7d4570ba5db53a9eb3fa139e2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-kf.land--plan","local_name":"bob-cli-kf.land-